  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 16244449280
    m_Localized: 'Queen''s Chamber: laying eggs that you can use for different commercial
      management, such as: building buildings, raising new ants, improving constructions,
      etc. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 18970746880
    m_Localized: "Breeding room: here you can create different types of ants. Each
      one needs certain resources to grow and is better for circumstances different
      from the others.\r\nThe workers\u2019 ants will not leave the anthill, but
      they will be responsible for transporting materials and guarding inside. "
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 21265031168
    m_Localized: 'Storage and garden of fungi: food and construction materials are
      kept. In addition, food will be produced from time to time thanks to the fungi
      that grow in this type of chambers. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 345286429810688
    m_Localized: 'Fodder chamber: the scouts will carry the construction materials
      and food collected during the explorations there, and the workers will be responsible
      for transporting it to the storage rooms. '
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
